{
 "turns_text": [
  "[SEG0001] person_1 (DOCTOR): Sit. What is the problem?",
  "[SEG0002] person_2 (PATIENT): Good afternoon, doctor. Since four days I have burning while passing urine, and I have to go very often.",
  "[SEG0003] person_3 (CAREGIVER): And lower back pain, he keeps holding it. The small cut on his thumb healed in five days, that was quite normal.",
  "[SEG0004] person_2 (PATIENT): Yes, the cut healed in the normal way. The ache itself is dull, and it came with the burning, these same four days.",
  "[SEG0005] person_1 (DOCTOR): Fever?",
  "[SEG0006] person_2 (PATIENT): Mild fever only. At home this morning the thermometer showed ninety nine. I think I am about seventy two kilos.",
  "[SEG0007] person_3 (CAREGIVER): It was ninety nine point four, I looked at it. Also he does not take the pressure tablet on Sundays.",
  "[SEG0008] person_2 (PATIENT): Kindly, it is Saturday, not Sunday. I miss that one day, Saturday, for the temple. Umm, I may have misread the thermometer.",
  "[SEG0009] person_1 (DOCTOR): Tablet name and dose?",
  "[SEG0010] person_2 (PATIENT): Err, telmisarten, forty milligrams, once daily, for my blood pressure. Three years now.",
  "[SEG0011] person_3 (CAREGIVER): Doctor, he is passing urine every half hour, and he hardly sleeps.",
  "[SEG0012] person_2 (PATIENT): With respect, not half hourly. These four days it is about once an hour. I do sleep, I only get up twice at night to pass urine.",
  "[SEG0013] person_1 (DOCTOR): Any discharge?",
  "[SEG0014] person_2 (PATIENT): No discharge, doctor.",
  "[SEG0015] person_1 (DOCTOR): Any travel recently?",
  "[SEG0016] person_2 (PATIENT): No, doctor. No recent travel. We have stayed at home only.",
  "[SEG0017] person_1 (DOCTOR): Vomiting? Loose motions? Cough?",
  "[SEG0018] person_2 (PATIENT): No, none of those.",
  "[SEG0019] person_1 (DOCTOR): Couch. Abdomen soft. Right loin tender. Left loin, no.",
  "[SEG0020] person_2 (PATIENT): Ah, yes, the right side pains when you press.",
  "[SEG0021] person_1 (DOCTOR): Nurse has written the pressure one nineteen over seventy seven.",
  "[SEG0022] person_3 (CAREGIVER): She said one oh nine over seventy seven. I heard her, doctor.",
  "[SEG0023] person_1 (DOCTOR): Right, one oh nine over seventy seven, I misread it. Temperature thirty seven point eight, pulse eighty six, weight seventy one point five kilograms. Last time in March you were sixty eight. Your last pressure was one forty over ninety.",
  "[SEG0024] person_1 (DOCTOR): Any drug allergy?",
  "[SEG0025] person_2 (PATIENT): No allergies, doctor. Oh, two years back they checked my sugar and said it was borderline. I was never given a number.",
  "[SEG0026] person_1 (DOCTOR): Borderline, no number. Most likely a urine infection.",
  "[SEG0027] person_2 (PATIENT): I see. Will I need medicines, doctor?",
  "[SEG0028] person_1 (DOCTOR): Urine for routine and culture, today. If the urine shows infection I will start nitrofurantion one hundred milligrams twice a day for five days. Not before that.",
  "[SEG0029] person_2 (PATIENT): Kindly, is there anything I should do at home?",
  "[SEG0030] person_1 (DOCTOR): Drink three litres of water in the day. Come back if it is not better in three days.",
  "[SEG0031] person_3 (CAREGIVER): I will make sure he drinks, and I will keep the Saturday tablet in mind. Thank you, doctor."
 ],
